.TH RANMA-LAYOUT-PREVIEW 1 "" "ranma 0.4.0" "ranma manual"
.SH NAME
ranma\-layout\-preview \- Draw what a \fBranma.placement\fR from your config lays out, as numbered boxes, without a server: \fBranma layout\-preview centred 120x40 \-\-panes 4\fR
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBranma layout\-preview\fR [\fB\-\-panes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> [\fISIZE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw what a \fBranma.placement\fR from your config lays out, as numbered boxes, without a server: \fBranma layout\-preview centred 120x40 \-\-panes 4\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-panes\fR \fI<PANES>\fR [default: 3]
How many panes to lay out
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The placement\*(Aqs name
.TP
[\fISIZE\fR] [default: 80x24]
The area, WIDTHxHEIGHT in cells
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBranma\fR(1)
